+
+History selection invalidates model-history and runtime-context projections. A selected path without a request header starts from the Agent's configured route. Authored-message deduplication follows selected history, so an initial prefix omitted by selection can be admitted again without changing its producer identity. No branch-specific Loop phase is used.
