+Request-message providers use agent/request-messages after input and prompt admission and request-header logging. A provider records request/messages, confirms its own durability requirement, then returns that record's sequence. The Loop validates turn/step ownership, resolves and freezes messages through Session's request reader, and uses that same reader in its reconstruction invariant. No provider means ordinary selected history. The hook changes neither pre-step admission nor transcript selection; producer failures stop dispatch.
